":{},"source":"## ✅ Checklist CORS - Headers Attendus\n\n**Headers CORS Obligatoires :**\n- `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *` ou domaine spécifique\n- `Access-Control-Allow-Methods: *`  \n- `Access-Control-Allow-Headers: *, Authorization`\n- `Access-Control-Expose-Headers: *` ou `X-Total-Count`\n- `Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true`\n\n**Headers Métier Exposés :**\n- `X-Total-Count: [nombre]` pour pagination React-Admin\n- `Content-Range` si utilisé\n- Headers custom selon besoins\n\n**Statuts HTTP Attendus :**\n- `OPTIONS` requests → `200 OK` + headers CORS\n- Toutes méthodes → Headers CORS présents\n- Preflight automatique → Géré par plugin ILEastic"},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"tags":["shellscript"]},"outputs":[],"source":"curl -i \"http://localhost:44000/api/employees?_page=1&_limit=10&_sort=id&_order=ASC\""},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"tags":["shellscript"]},"outputs":[],"source":""},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"tags":["shellscript"]},"outputs":[],"source":"curl -i \"http://localhost:44000/api/employees?_page=1&_limit=10&_sort=empno&_order=ASC\""},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"tags":["shellscript"]},"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/markdown":"```\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\nDate: Mon, 04 May 2026 09:55:16 GMT\r\nServer: Apache\r\nLast-Modified: Thu, 09 Oct 2025 06:44:35 GMT\r\nETag: \"f61-640b4225bdac0\"\r\nAccept-Ranges: bytes\r\nContent-Length: 3937\r\nConnection: close\r\nContent-Type: text/html; charset=UTF-8\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n    <head>\n        <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n        <meta\n            name=\"viewport\"\n            content=\"minimum-scale=1, initial-scale=1, width=device-width, shrink-to-fit=no\"\n        />\n        <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#000000\" />\n        <link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"./manifest.json\" />\n        <link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"./favicon.ico\" />\n        <title>test-admin</title>\n        <style>\n            body {\n                margin: 0;\n                padding: 0;\n                font-family: sans-serif;\n            }\n\n            .loader-container {\n                display: flex;\n                align-items: center;\n                justify-content: center;\n                flex-direction: column;\n                position: absolute;\n                top: 0;\n                bottom: 0;\n                left: 0;\n                right: 0;\n                background-color: #fafafa;\n            }\n\n            /* CSS Spinner from https://projects.lukehaas.me/css-loaders/ */\n\n            .loader,\n            .loader:before,\n            .loader:after {\n                border-radius: 50%;\n            }\n\n            .loader {\n                color: #283593;\n                font-size: 11px;\n                text-indent: -99999em;\n                margin: 55px auto;\n                position: relative;\n                width: 10em;\n                height: 10em;\n                box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1em;\n                -webkit-transform: translateZ(0);\n                -ms-transform: translateZ(0);\n                transform: translateZ(0);\n            }\n\n            .loader:before,\n            .loader:after {\n                position: absolute;\n                content: '';\n            }\n\n            .loader:before {\n                width: 5.2em;\n                height: 10.2em;\n                background: #fafafa;\n                border-radius: 10.2em 0 0 10.2em;\n                top: -0.1em;\n                left: -0.1em;\n                -webkit-transform-origin: 5.2em 5.1em;\n                transform-origin: 5.2em 5.1em;\n                -webkit-animation: load2 2s infinite ease 1.5s;\n                animation: load2 2s infinite ease 1.5s;\n            }\n\n            .loader:after {\n                width: 5.2em;\n                height: 10.2em;\n                backg